WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.167
Shapes and their sides

2
00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:09.400
Shapes are painted on the school wall. Let us count their sides.

3
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.467
A triangle has three sides.

4
00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:15.300
A square has four equal sides.

5
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:20.533
A pentagon has five sides and a hexagon has six.

6
00:00:20.533 --> 00:00:23.600
A circle has no sides and no corners.
